{"ref":"BDB, שׁוֹט","hw":"שׁוֹט","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹט</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.15\">Is 28:15</a></sup> <strong>scourge, whip (</strong>NH id., so Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">سَوْطٌ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">سَاطَ (و)</span> <em>mix, stir about and beat;</em> Ethiopic ሰውጥ: Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹטָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܫܰܘܛܳܐ</span>; from foregoing? cf. Germ. <em>streifen;</em> or onomat., cf. <em>swish, switch?</em><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.26\">Is 10:26</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Job 5:21\" href=\"/Job.5.21\">Jb 5:21</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹטִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.11\">1 K 12:11</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>scourge</em>, for chastisement, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.11\">1 K 12:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.14\">14</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.11\">2 Ch 10:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 10:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.10.12\">12</a> (all c. vb. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִסַּר</span>); fig. of national scourge (wielded by <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.26\">Is 10:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.15\">28:15</a> (Qr; > Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁיט</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.18\">18</a> (both <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ שׁוֹטֵף</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁטַף\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁטַף\", dir=\"rtl\">שׁטף</a>), calamity <a data-ref=\"Job 9:23\" href=\"/Job.9.23\">Jb 9:23</a>; <em>lash</em> of (accusing) tongue <a data-ref=\"Job 5:21\" href=\"/Job.5.21\">Jb 5:21</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשּׁ׳</span> as 𝔊).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>whip</em>, for horse, <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:2\" href=\"/Nahum.3.2\">Na 3:2</a> i.e. <em>crack of whip</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ לַסּוּס</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.3\">Pr 26:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁבֶט לְגֵו כְּסִילִים</span>).","next":"BDB, שֹׁטֵט","prev":"BDB, שׁוּט"}